# Member 1 — platform

Read `docs/team/member-1/README.md` and `docs/tasks.md`.

- Only the commit path creates a `board_snapshot`. Only Dispatch appends `status_event`.
- `decision_log` is append-only via a hosted tool, not ad-hoc SQL from the agent package.
- Untrusted text in `*_raw`. Demo logins, not Cognito.
- Stale snapshot and missing medium-risk approval must fail closed (UC-07, UC-12).
- `POST /api/demo/reset` restores Eastwind Tuesday (UC-10).
- Product APIs: `/api/schedule/current`, events, proposals, decision, commit, audit, `/api/demo/reset`. Do not recreate intake/coordinator/webhooks.
- Do not reimplement ranking in SQL. Do not fill `infra/apprunner|cognito|rds` or `src/platform/aws/`.
- Memory adapter is what unblocks members 2–4. Prefer shipping that over Lightsail polish before G1.
